              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "pingar — \"to drip\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A torneira pinga toda a noite. The tap drips all night."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Um pingo — a drop. In Portugal um pingo is also a small coffee with milk."
            }
          ]
